#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
