#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY"
msgid "It doesn't want to play anymore."
msgstr "Воно більше не хоче гратися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK"
msgid "Coming back to play some more?"
msgstr "Ще хочеться погратися?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "Aaw, the twirly is gone."
msgstr "Е-ех, крутилка зламалася."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED"
msgid "We never knew there was so much to learn about this stuff!"
msgstr "Ми не знали, що можна стільки всього нового дізнатися про цю штуку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1"
msgid "Owie, that was not a nice plant!"
msgstr "О-ой, то була погана рослина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2"
msgid "Eek, we feel all burny inside!"
msgstr "А-ай, ми відчуваємо, як усередині все горить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE"
msgid "Whew, we'll be more careful not to touch strange weeds."
msgstr "Фу-ух, ми постараємося більше не торкатися дивних бур'янів."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN"
msgid "Oh, someone's calling us to come over."
msgstr "Ой, хтось кличе нас, щоб ми прийшли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD"
msgid "We float!"
msgstr "Ми плаваємо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO"
msgid "Weeee!"
msgstr "Уі-і-і-і!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED"
msgid "We're tired!"
msgstr "Ми втомилися!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FOODMEMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FOODMEMORY"
msgid "only_used_by_warly"
msgstr "only_used_by_warly"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM"
msgid "We made it!"
msgstr "Вдалося!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN"
msgid "We're becoming... even more monstrous!"
msgstr "Ми стаємо... ще більшим чудовиськом!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GHOST_QUEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GHOST_QUEST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED"
msgid "That spray tickles!"
msgstr "Від тої пшикалки нам лоскотно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE"
msgid "We'd better not go out in the acid rain until we put on more repellent."
msgstr "Нам краще не гуляти під кислотним дощем, поки на нас не буде більше протикислотного засобу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "We'd better not play near fire anymore!"
msgstr "Краще нам більше не гратися біля вогню!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE"
msgid "Wheeeeee!"
msgstr "У-у-у-і-і-і-і-і!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT"
msgid "Aw! Why didn't it work?"
msgstr "Агов! Чому не працює?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH"
msgid "I'm learning so much!"
msgstr "Я дізнаюся стільки нового!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HOT"
msgid "Hot as heck!"
msgstr "Нам дуже спекотно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS"
msgid "Doggies are coming!"
msgstr "Песики наближаються!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY"
msgid "It's time for a snack!"
msgstr "Час перекусити!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK"
msgid "We feel better sticking to the safer trail."
msgstr "Нам спокійніше, коли ми йдемо безпечнішим шляхом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
