msgstr "Ми знаємо, що так треба."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe we could have been friends."
msgstr "Може, ми могли б бути друзями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING"
