msgstr "only_used_by_wolfgang"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_COLD"
msgid "The ambient temperature is low."
msgstr "Спостерігається низька температура навколишнього середовища."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT"
msgid "My compass has become demagnetized."
msgstr "Мій компас розмагнітився."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP"
msgid "I suppose it was worth a try."
msgstr "Гадаю, спроба була того варта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL"
msgid "I can't make that now."
msgstr "Наразі я не можу це зробити."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DAMP"
msgid "The layer of water begins to build up."
msgstr "Шар води починає збільшуватись."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "That sounds quite large!"
msgstr "Наближається хтось великий!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN"
msgid "I've never read anything describing this!"
msgstr "У книжках не було про це жодного слова!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "Oh my, what came over me?"
msgstr "Лишенько, що на мене найшло?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "Back to the the natural state of things."
msgstr "Все повернулось до звичного стану речей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "Did I just feel a raindrop?"
msgstr "Я щойно відчула краплю дощу?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "It appears my defense has weakened."
msgstr "Здається, мій захист ослаб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "How strange, I do in fact feel a bit tired..."
msgstr "Як дивно. Щось я й справді трохи втомилась..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "I can only work tirelessly for so long."
msgstr "Моєї невтомної праці вистачить тільки на такий проміжок часу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Caught it just in time. The roots were nearly rotten."
msgstr "Вчасно викопала. Коріння вже майже згнило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "Night will be here soon."
msgstr "Незабаром прийде ніч."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Yum!"
msgstr "Смачно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "This cannot be consumed."
msgstr "Я не буду це вживати."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "I should not have ingested that."
msgstr "Не варто було це споживати."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED"
msgid "That was partially decomposed."
msgstr "Їжа встигла частково розкластись."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE"
msgid "That was not at optimal freshness."
msgstr "Не скажу, що їжа була оптимальної свіжості."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY"
msgid "Ingesting this would be ill-advised."
msgstr "Споживання цієї їжі — це дуже необачний крок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING"
msgid "I couldn't possibly eat this all myself!"
msgstr "Сама б я ніколи не змогла все це подужати!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED"
msgid "That will do nicely."
msgstr "Ось це вже інша справа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION"
msgid "My eyes have been adjusted to the darkness."
msgstr "Мої очі звикли до темряви."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED"
msgid "Strength is wasted on the young!"
msgstr "Не тільки юним бути дужими!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER"
msgid "That is too strong."
msgstr "Він надміру міцний."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
msgid "It's all in the legs."
msgstr "Вся справа у ногах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2"
msgid "Goodness..."
msgstr "Лишенько..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3"
msgid "Dear me..."
msgstr "Боже мій..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4"
msgid "I've got it, dear."
msgstr "У мене все вийде, дорогенька."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5"
msgid "I'm more spry than I look!"
msgstr "Я куди моторніша, ніж здаюсь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6"
msgid "You just need to know how to lift!"
msgstr "Просто треба знати, як правильно підняти!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7"
msgid "No sweat off my back! Ho ho!"
msgstr "Як по писаному! Хо-хо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8"
msgid "How invigorating!"
msgstr "Як бадьорить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9"
msgid "This gets the blood pumping!"
msgstr "Від цього аж кров грає!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_DOWNGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_DOWNGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_UPGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_UPGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
msgid "I am in the dark."
msgstr "Я в темряві."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT"
msgid "It is bright enough to see."
msgstr "Тепер я маю достатньо світла, щоби бачити."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB"
msgid "I do not wish to experience that again."
msgstr "Я б не воліла переживати це знов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE"
msgid "Something from outside our dimension is trying to come in."
msgstr "Щось з іншого виміру намагається сюди потрапити."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY"
msgid "I suppose the daylight gives it a migraine."
msgstr "Думаю, що від денного світла у нього починається мігрень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK"
msgid "This ocular creature seems rather persistent."
msgstr "Схоже, що дана окулярна істота є доволі впертою."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "This fragile device has decayed."
msgstr "Тендітний прилад розпавсь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED"
msgid "Even with my considerable gardening experience, there's always something new to learn."
msgstr "Навіть із моїм чималим досвідом у садівництві завжди можна дізнатись щось нове."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.1"
msgid "Oh dear... I seem to be afflicted by the plant's toxin."
msgstr "Ой леле... Схоже, на мене подіяв токсин даної рослини."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN.2"
msgid "The toxin from those nettles carries a rather unpleasant burning sensation."
msgstr "Токсин даної кропиви викликає доволі неприємне відчуття печіння."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE"
msgid "Thankfully, the toxin's effects seem to be temporary."
msgstr "На щастя, схоже, дія токсину є тимчасовою."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN"
msgid "Someone's fired a flare."
msgstr "Хтось випустив сигнальну ракету."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD"
msgid "Hmm, rather convenient."
msgstr "Гм-м, доволі зручно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO"
msgid "Time for a dip!"
msgstr "Час занурюватись!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED"
msgid "I just need to catch my breath."
msgstr "Мені лиш потрібно перевести подих."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FOODMEMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FOODMEMORY"
msgid "only_used_by_warly"
msgstr "only_used_by_warly"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM"
msgid "Freedom! I'll find a good book and tuck in."
msgstr "Свобода! Знайду гарну книгу та загорнусь у ковдру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN"
msgid "My humanity... it's slipping."
msgstr "Я втрачаю... людяність."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GHOST_QUEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GHOST_QUEST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED"
msgid "Ah... my mind feels clearer, somehow."
msgstr "Ах... у голові сяк-так починає прояснюватись."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE"
msgid "I believe my immunity from acidic rainfall has concluded."
msgstr "Гадаю, моя несприйнятливість до кислотних атмосферних опадів вичерпалась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "It would seem I am vulnerable to the flames once more."
msgstr "Схоже, я знову стала вразливою до вогню."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE"
msgid "Ah yes. I have now arrived at Pearl's home."
msgstr "Так, так. Нині я опинилась біля оселі Перлинки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT"
msgid "It's not responding for some reason."
msgstr "Чомусь вона не реагує на мої дії."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH"
msgid "My my, that was extremely interesting!"
msgstr "Ой-йой, це було надзвичайно цікаво!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOT"
msgid "The ambient temperature is high."
msgstr "Спостерігається висока температура навколишнього середовища."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS"
msgid "Something is approaching."
msgstr "Щось наближається."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY"
msgid "Librarian needs food."
msgstr "Бібліотекарка потребує їжі."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK"
msgid "This trail will likely yield less dangerous results."
msgstr "Даний шлях, найімовірніше, призведе до менш плачевних наслідків."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
msgid "The appearance of this track indicates recent activity."
msgstr "Поява даного сліду свідчить про нещодавню активність."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
msgid "The trail is no longer distinguishable."
msgstr "Тепер слід ледь помітний."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
msgid "The trail's been washed away by the precipitation."
msgstr "Слід розмило внаслідок випадіння опадів."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK"
msgid "I suspect whatever lies at the end of this trail will be formidable."
msgstr "Мені здається, що в кінці даного шляху на мене очікуватиме щось страшне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK"
msgid "It seems I've managed to track the creature without alerting it."
msgstr "Схоже, мені вдалось вистежити істоту й вона про це навіть не здогадується."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK"
msgid "Oh dear... I have the most peculiar sensation that I'm being observed."
msgstr "Ой леле... У мене дуже химерне відчуття, що за мною спостерігають."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER"
msgid "It needs just a touch more fecal assistance, I'd say."
msgstr "Думаю, їй треба надати фекальну допомогу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL"
msgid "I can't carry anything more."
msgstr "Я не можу нести більше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING"
msgid "I hope everyone remembered to wash their hands before eating."
msgstr "Сподіваюсь, ніхто не забув помити руки перед тим, як сідати їсти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD"
msgid "Poor dear, are you lost?"
msgstr "Бідолаха, ти загубивсь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.1"
msgid "Ah, there you are."
msgstr "А, ось ти де."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.2"
msgid "It seems I've discovered a kitten."
msgstr "Схоже, що я знайшла кошеня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.3"
msgid "I could see your tail from the distance, dear."
msgstr "Твій хвостик було видно здалеку, дорогенький."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.4"
msgid "Finding kittens is quite simple once you become accustomed to it."
msgstr "Шукати кошенят не так-то й складно, просто треба трохи набити руку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE"
msgid "I found all of the missing kittens."
msgstr "Я знайшла всіх кошенят, що ховались."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE_TEAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE_TEAM"
msgid "We found all of the missing kittens."
msgstr "Ми знайшли всіх кошенят, що ховались."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE"
msgid "One more kitten has been encountered."
msgstr "Знайшлося ще одне кошеня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME"
msgid "It appears we did not find them all in time."
msgstr "Схоже на те, що нам не вдалось учасно всіх знайти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "The end of the game draws closer."
msgstr "Наближається кінець гри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR"
msgid "I am distancing myself from where the game is happening."
msgstr "Наразі я дистанціююсь від місця, де відбувається гра."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN"
msgid "The kittens should be over here, yes."
msgstr "Кошенята мають бути десь тут, так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN"
msgid "Excuse me, I will join the feline search."
msgstr "Даруйте, я доєднаюсь до пошуку котових."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START"
msgid "The game has commenced, I should start seeking."
msgstr "Гру розпочато. Треба вирушати на пошуки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP"
msgid "Careful! It has summoned lesser Krampii."
msgstr "Обережно! Він викликав менших Крампусів."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE"
msgid "No sense throwing one's life away. Fall back!"
msgstr "Немає сенсу ризикувати своїм життям. Відступаймо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED"
msgid "Whatever enchantment restrained it has been undone."
msgstr "Які б чари не стримували його, їх більше немає."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT"
msgid "Oof, that's one way to get some rest, I suppose."
msgstr "Ох, нічогенький такий спосіб ненадовго відпочити."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED"
msgid "Thank goodness for this non-conductive clothing!"
msgstr "Дякувати небесам, що існує одяг, який не проводить струм!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND"
msgid "That insufferable hand appears to be impeding the puzzle's resolution!"
msgstr "Схоже, та нестерпна рука перешкоджає розв'язанню головоломки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH"
msgid "Not a great resource, but there were useful bits."
msgstr "Не найкращий ресурс, але часточка користі в ньому присутня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING"
msgid "Not you again!"
msgstr "Тільки не ти!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES"
msgid "Those poor birds never stood a chance in the hail storm."
msgstr "Ті бідолашні птахи не мали жодного шансу пережити градову бурю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS"
msgid "What a dreadful sound."
msgstr "Який жаский звук."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "I suspect a powerful influx of energy is the source of that strange glow."
msgstr "Мені здається, що джерелом даного незвичного сяйва є потужний приплив енергії."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS"
msgid "Well, yes. The rules of chess are simple. One may have no more than a pair of these pieces."
msgstr "Що ж, так. Правила шахів прості. Жоден не може мати більше однієї пари фігур."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN"
msgid "Oh my. Someone is looking to initiate a conflict."
msgstr "Ой леле. Хтось бажає спровокувати конфлікт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1"
msgid "Oh dear... that gland is really disagreeing with me..."
msgstr "Лишенько... від тієї залози в мене почалась страшенна печія..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2"
msgid "It appears that gland was not safe for consumption after all."
msgstr "Схоже, та залоза була все ж не дуже придатною для вживання."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "That was a lesson painfully learned."
msgstr "Що ж, я засвоїла дуже болісний урок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1"
msgid "What an unusual sensation."
msgstr "Яке незвичайне відчуття."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE"
msgid "Oh dear. This is an unfortunate development."
msgstr "Ой леле. Який сумний розвиток подій."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK"
msgid "Ah. Much better."
msgstr "О-о. Так значно краще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW"
msgid "Nearly there."
msgstr "Майже готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED"
msgid "I'm coming, dear."
msgstr "Я вже йду, любчику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL"
msgid "Tada!"
msgstr "Та-да!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW"
msgid "Nearly there."
msgstr "Майже готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED"
msgid "I'm coming, dear."
msgstr "Я вже йду, любчику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL"
msgid "Tada!"
msgstr "Та-да!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW"
msgid "Nearly there."
msgstr "Майже готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED"
msgid "I'm coming, dear."
msgstr "Я вже йду, любчику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL"
msgid "Tada!"
msgstr "Та-да!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED"
msgid "Oh dear, that didn't go as planned."
msgstr "Ой леле, не так сталось, як гадалось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS"
msgid "Cursed bloodsuckers!"
msgstr "Кляті кровопивці!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH"
msgid "My mount requires attention of the medical variety."
msgstr "Моя тварина потребує догляду медичного характеру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL"
msgid "Buzzards drawn by carrion, naturally. However, these exhibit signs of mutation."
msgstr "Цілком природно, що стерв'ятників приваблює мертвеччина. Однак дані особини демонструють ознаки мутації."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT"
msgid "Presents are not a top survival priority at this moment."
msgstr "Наразі подарунки не є пріоритетом для виживання."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA"
msgid "I can't lie down when I'm in danger!"
msgstr "Я не можу лежати, коли мені загрожує небезпека!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP"
msgid "I can barely sleep even when I'm not in danger!"
msgstr "Мені й так важко заснути, навіть коли мені не загрожує небезпека!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP"
msgid "I can hardly get to sleep at night, never mind during the day."
msgstr "Я ледве можу заснути вночі, не кажучи вже про день."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE"
msgid "These caves don't make it any easier to sleep."
msgstr "Печери не допоможуть мені легше заснути."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA"
msgid "My hunger won't make relaxing any easier!"
msgstr "Мій голод ніяк не посприяє моєму відпочинку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP"
msgid "I can barely sleep even when I'm not starving!"
msgstr "Мені й так важко заснути, навіть коли я неголодна!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT"
msgid "I do believe I should dismount first."
msgstr "Думаю, спершу не завадило б злізти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
msgid "I can't sleep, no matter where I lie down."
msgstr "Я не можу заснути, де б я не лягла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
msgid "I couldn't possibly relax in these caves."
msgstr "Навіть у цих печерах не знайти мені спочинок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE"
msgid "A hot mess indeed."
msgstr "Ну й безлад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT"
msgid "No need to turn the light off dear, I won't be able to sleep either way."
msgstr "Не треба забирати в мене світло, я все одно не зможу заснути."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
msgid "Even if I could sleep, these temperatures are highly unsafe."
msgstr "Навіть якби я могла спати, при таких температурах це було б украй небезпечно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
msgid "As you can plainly see, it is ablaze."
msgstr "Чітко видно, що він у вогні."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NO_ABIGAIL_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NO_ABIGAIL_FLOWER"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP"
msgid "A cinch!"
msgstr "Простіше простого!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST"
msgid "Let's give that another go, shall we?"
msgstr "Може, спробуємо ще раз?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY"
msgid "I suppose there will be no fish dinner for me this time."
msgstr "Думаю, на цей раз вечеря буде без риби."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1"
msgid "Patience is a virtue."
msgstr "Терпіння породжує стійкість."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2"
msgid "I do not appreciate the tardiness of these fish."
msgstr "Я не в захваті від повільності даної риби."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3"
msgid "Perhaps if I tried a different lure..."
msgstr "Можливо, якби я спробувала іншу приманку..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4"
msgid "I wonder if I could get some reading done while I wait."
msgstr "Цікаво, чи зможу я щось почитати, поки чекатиму."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP"
msgid "Oh dear, I must have put too much strain on my line."
msgstr "Ой леле, думаю, я дуже сильно натягнула волосінь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE"
msgid "The line must remain taut!"
msgstr "Волосінь мусить залишатись натягнутою!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING"
msgid "The megafauna have set their eyes on us."
msgstr "Мегафауна звернула на нас увагу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT"
msgid "Perhaps a review of the script is in order, dear?"
msgstr "Можливо, варто переглянути сценарій, дорогенькі?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN"
msgid "It seems the den was more crucial to this platform's structural integrity than I surmised."
msgstr "Схоже, лігво було більш важливим для структурної цілісності даної платформи, ніж я собі думала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS"
msgid "This platform's construction will not withstand deeper waters."
msgstr "Конструкція даної платформи не витримає глибших вод."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "Settle down, this instant!"
msgstr "Заспокойсь! Негайно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "The chemical reaction has been catalyzed..."
msgstr "Хімічну реакцію було каталізовано..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "This plant is exhibiting concerning signs."
msgstr "Рослина одним своїм виглядом викликає серйозне занепокоєння."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE"
msgid "Oh dear, it's those troublemakers playing their loud music again..."
msgstr "Ой леле, знову ці порушники спокою зі своєю гучною музикою..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED"
msgid "Once it grows I'll be able to identify the species."
msgstr "Я зможу ідентифікувати вид, як тільки рослина виросте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1"
msgid "I've gained a bit more insight into the workings of this species."
msgstr "Я дізналась трохи більше про особливості даного виду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL"
msgid "Oof! Might I suggest realigning the exit point closer to the ground next time, dear?"
msgstr "Фу-ух! Можливо, нехай наступного разу точка виходу буде знаходитись ближче до землі, дорогенька?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID"
msgid "It will not hold!"
msgstr "Він не витримає!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
msgid "A tremor! At least magnitude seven on the Richter scale."
msgstr "Землетрус! Не менше семи балів за шкалою Ріхтера."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT"
msgid "This is obviously not the correct place for it."
msgstr "Очевидно, дане місце є не зовсім підхожим."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "Some form of creature is aggressively tunneling in the subterrain."
msgstr "Якесь створіння агресивно риється під землею."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "What a peculiar breed of rabbit!"
msgstr "Яка незвична порода кроликів!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT"
msgid "Got you!"
msgstr "Піймала!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "I hear the burrowing of a small creature."
msgstr "Я чую, як у землі риється мале створіння."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "There's magic at work here."
msgstr "Спрацювала магія."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "No information should go to waste, no matter how trivial."
msgstr "Жодна інформація не має пропасти даремно, якою б тривіальною вона не була."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "Oof! Back on my feet!"
msgstr "Фу-ух! Знову стала на ноги!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "Off you go now."
msgstr "Можеш іти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
msgid "Hold on a moment, dear."
msgstr "Почекай хвилинку, будь ласка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1"
msgid "Your Highness."
msgstr "Ваша високосте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2"
msgid "Your Grace."
msgstr "Ваша світлосте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3"
msgid "You wear her crown well."
msgstr "Її корона вам пасує."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1"
msgid "Your \"Highness\"."
msgstr "Ваша «високосте»."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2"
msgid "Your \"Grace\"."
msgstr "Ваша «світлосте»."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3"
msgid "You wear that \"crown\" well."
msgstr "Ця «корона» вам пасує."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET"
msgid "Careful, the monsters are back."
msgstr "Обережно, почвари повернулись."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO"
msgid "Shoot. I thought I had it."
msgstr "Трясця. Думала, що вдасться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES"
msgid "That did the trick."
msgstr "Вдалось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL"
msgid "My scrapbook has already been completed."
msgstr "Мій нотатник уже заповнено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING"
msgid "It is attracted to this device."
msgstr "Його приваблює даний пристрій."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH"
msgid "I've been bitten by a camouflaged creature!"
msgstr "Мене вкусило замасковане створіння!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "As nonsensical as it sounds, there is something dark about that \"light\"..."
msgstr "Як би безглуздо це не звучало, але у тому «світлі» є щось темне..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER"
msgid "Ah, a welcome respite."
msgstr "Довгоочікуваний перепочинок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_BLOSSOM"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SISTURN_FULL_EVIL"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNARED"
msgid "You can't hold me for long, dear."
msgstr "Ти не зможеш довго тримати мене, любчику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY"
msgid "Goodness, my garden seems to have quite an aggressive weed problem."
msgstr "Лишенько, здається, мій город зіткнувся з навалою агресивних бур'янів."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW"
msgid "There's no snow here to roll it in."
msgstr "Сніжка не скачається — немає снігу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG"
msgid "It has reached its full size."
msgstr "Вона досягла свого повного розміру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED"
msgid "Positively soaked."
msgstr "Змокла до рубця."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
msgid "Goodness gracious!"
msgstr "Хай Бог милує!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1"
msgid "Talking to my little garden always seemed to help it grow."
msgstr "Думаю, якщо поговорити з рослинами, то це посприяє їхньому росту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2"
msgid "My, those leaves are coming in quite nicely, dear!"
msgstr "Лишенько, як гарно в тебе ростуть листочки, дорогенька!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3"
msgid "All one needs to thrive is a bit of love and care, isn't that right?"
msgstr "Все, що треба для процвітання — це трохи любові та турботи, хіба не так?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4"
msgid "No need to rush dear, you just take your time."
msgstr "Не треба поспішати, дорогенька. Рости у своє задоволення."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5"
msgid "How are you doing today? Do you have enough water?"
msgstr "Як поживаєш? Тобі не бракує водички?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THORNS"
msgid "Dang spinose structure!"
msgstr "Клята кілка структура!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT"
msgid "That's that."
msgstr "Ось і все."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED"
msgid "It appears I will have to continue the search alone."
msgstr "Здається, мені доведеться продовжувати пошуки власноруч."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD"
msgid "Oh, how terrible! I suppose I'm on my own now."
msgstr "Ой, який жах! Гадаю, тепер доведеться робити все самій."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION"
msgid "Don't worry, dear, I'm coming."
msgstr "Не хвилюйсь, любчику. Я вже йду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON"
msgid "Someone arrived before us and found our kitten."
msgstr "Хтось уже побував тут до нас і знайшов кошеня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON"
msgid "He believes we're near one of the kittens."
msgstr "Він думає, що ми вже десь поруч із кошенятами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "There appears to be a clear lack of hiding evidence."
msgstr "Простежується очевидна відсутність доказів, що тут хтось ховається."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING"
msgid "I believe he has caught the kitten's scent."
msgstr "Думаю, він натрапив на слід кошеняти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER"
msgid "He is awaiting my lead."
msgstr "Він чекає мого сигналу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
msgid "It has burrowed away."
msgstr "Вона зарилась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING"
msgid "It will need to burrow soon to rehydrate its skin."
msgstr "Незабаром вона зариється задля регідрації шкіри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP"
msgid "My grip!"
msgstr "Мої руки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK"
msgid "This will require a more robust tool."
msgstr "Треба використати дужче знаряддя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT"
msgid "I need another light."
msgstr "Мені треба ще одне джерело світла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
msgid "Goodness! That's one way to travel."
msgstr "Лишенько! Ось це я розумію — спосіб подорожувати."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF"
msgid "Eek!"
msgstr "А-а-а!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "Tut tut, I don't think it's quite ready."
msgstr "А-я-яй, не думаю, що тут усе готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST"
msgid "It would seem we are aligned with the shadowy beasts against a common foe."
msgstr "Схоже, боротьба проти спільного ворога помирила нас із тіньовими чудовиськами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING"
msgid "It must be an issue with the receiving end."
msgstr "Гадаю, тут несправним є об'єкт, що приймає."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE"
msgid "I hope my books weren't ruined."
msgstr "Сподіваюсь, мої книги не постраждали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT"
msgid "I'm afraid it's in no condition to race."
msgstr "На жаль, вона не в тому стані, щоби брати участь у перегонах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK"
msgid "This calls for something more formidable."
msgstr "Гадаю, тут знадобиться щось більш грізне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT"
msgid "Weight: {weight}"
msgstr "Вага: {weight}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nThis specimen is decidedly larger than average."
msgstr "Вага: {weight}\nДана особина безперечно більша за звичайну."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WENDY_BABYSITTER_SET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WENDY_BABYSITTER_SET"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WENDY_BABYSITTER_STOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WENDY_BABYSITTER_STOP"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WET"
msgid "I wonder what my body's saturation point is..."
msgstr "Цікаво, яка точка насичення в мого тіла?.."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WETTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WETTER"
msgid "Wet, wet, wet!"
msgstr "Мокро, мокро, мокро!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS"
msgid "This will require a bit more precision on my part."
msgstr "З мого боку треба діяти більш точно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM"
msgid "Oh dear... perhaps it's time to clean my glasses."
msgstr "Ой леле... Мабуть, мені варто протерти окуляри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF"
msgid "Intriguing! I appear to be filled with \"cheer\"."
msgstr "Як цікаво! Схоже, мене пройняла святкова атмосфера."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER"
msgid "That was very illuminating."
msgstr "Я аж сяю від радості, що побувала на такому бенкеті."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WOLFGANG_BEGIN_COACHING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WOLFGANG_BEGIN_COACHING"
msgid "only_used_by_wolfgang"
msgstr "only_used_by_wolfgang"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WOLFGANG_END_COACHING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WOLFGANG_END_COACHING"
msgid "only_used_by_wolfgang"
msgstr "only_used_by_wolfgang"

