msgstr "Або ти, або я!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.BATTLECRY.PIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.BATTLECRY.PIG"
msgid "Stupid pig!"
msgstr "Дурна свиня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.BATTLECRY.PREY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.BATTLECRY.PREY"
