msgstr "Фу-у-у, вбийте його!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
