msgstr "Хех. Дивина..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "Okay, hear me out... what if I tried burning it?"
msgstr "Гаразд, слухайте... а що, як мені спалити його?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
