msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "Looks like dumb science stuff for nerds."
msgstr "Це схоже на дурнуватий науковий мотлох для мудрагелів."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "It's a burning man."
msgstr "Це що, свято якесь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Just burnt straw."
msgstr "Звичайна горіла солома."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
