msgstr "Гм... я можу створювати речі, які не горять?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "I guess that's good, too."
msgstr "Теж непогано, гадаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Not burnable. Not interested."
msgstr "Не горюча. Не цікаво."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
