msgstr "Хитун-Бовтун знову цілісний."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "Фе! Вона дриґається!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "The crank doesn't even turn!"
msgstr "Завідна ручка навіть не повертається!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "Gross. I don't think that was supposed to come off."
msgstr "Гидота. Не думаю, що вона мала відпасти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It's a marble statue, I guess."
msgstr "Це схоже на мармурову статую."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "He didn't even say \"thank you\"."
msgstr "Вона навіть не подякувала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "Фе! Вона дриґається!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "That thing looks terrible."
msgstr "У неї жахливий вигляд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Great, now we've irritated some marble crime boss!"
msgstr "Чудово, тепер ми ще й розізлили якогось боса мармурової мафії!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Looks like a bunch of rubble to me."
msgstr "Як на мене, це просто купа каміння."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "I'm more used to destroying things than fixing them."
msgstr "Я більше звикла знищувати речі, ніж їх лагодити."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "Фе! Вона дриґається!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
