msgstr "Засвітло для сну."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE"
