#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT"
