msgstr "Огидно, але Вольфґанґ не може не дивитися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC"
msgid "Is very bad luck."
msgstr "Дуже не пощастило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
