msgstr "That's a fancy workbench."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1"
msgid "Yeah, Luce. The glove is as real as you or me."
msgstr "Yeah, Luce. The glove is as real as you or me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2"
msgid "That is an actual real live clipboard."
msgstr "That is an actual real live clipboard."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY"
msgid "Hey! Someone's littered up the natural landscape!"
msgstr "Гей! Хтось забруднив природний ляндшафт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE"
msgid "Can't make heads or tails of it myself, but it seems important."
msgstr "Хоч оком світи, нічого не розберу, але виглядає важне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC"
msgid "Looks like you're doing somthin' important. How aboot I lend you a hand, eh?"
msgstr "Схоже, ти робиш шось важливе. Чим я можу тобі допомогти, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS"
msgid "Sounds like he could use our help, eh?"
msgstr "Здається, йому треба наша поміч, еге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK"
msgid "Where's that old-timer running off to?"
msgstr "Куди той дідуган тікає?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1"
msgid "I'd better run it back to that old-timer."
msgstr "Ліпше повернути його тому дідуганові."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2"
msgid "Not really sure what it is, but maybe I'll bring it to that old-timer just in case."
msgstr "Не зовсім певен, що це таке, але про всяк випадок, варто віднести його тому дідуганові."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3"
msgid "Hey Luce, does that look like a whatever-he-said to you?"
msgstr "Гей, Люсі, хіба він не схожий на те, про що він тобі розповідав?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4"
msgid "Wouldn't hurt to see if this is what that old-timer's been looking for."
msgstr "Не завадило б перевірити, чи це те, що шукав той дідуган."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5"
msgid "That might be just the thing I'm lookin' for!"
msgstr "Це, можливо, саме те, що я шукаю!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK"
msgid "Hopefully we don't have to abandon ship."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, нам не доведеться нею скористатися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT"
msgid "Hopefully we don't have to abandon ship."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, нам не доведеться нею скористатися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS"
msgid "Hopefully we don't have to abandon ship."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, нам не доведеться нею скористатися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD"
msgid "You can fancy it up, but I still don't want to use it."
msgstr "Її можна прикрасити, але я ще не готовий нею скористатися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK"
msgid "A bird, huh? Real funny, Luce."
msgstr "Птах, гм? Дотепно, Люсі."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE"
msgid "Not exactly cozy, eh?"
msgstr "Не дуже від неї затишно, еге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM"
msgid "I'd rather build walls out of lumber."
msgstr "Я радше збудую стіни з деревини."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that escalated quickly."
msgstr "Що ж, було, та загуло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC"
msgid "You could sneeze it down."
msgstr "Хтось чхне — і поминай, чи вона тут стояла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM"
msgid "I could sneeze it apart."
msgstr "Та я чхну — і поминай, чи вона взагалі існувала."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Looks nice'n'sturdy."
msgstr "Виглядає гарно й солідно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "It's not much use like that."
msgstr "Поки простоює, від неї небагато користи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "Crumbling, but still secure, eh?"
msgstr "Розсипається, а все стоїть, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2"
msgid "Crumbling, but still secure, eh?"
msgstr "Розсипається, а все стоїть, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "Heh, stoned again, eh?"
msgstr "...Знову каміння, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP"
msgid "Are walls supposed to smell?"
msgstr "Стіни хіба мають пахнути?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM"
msgid "Are walls supposed to smell?"
msgstr "Стіни хіба мають пахнути?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "Safe and secure, eh?"
msgstr "Безпечна й надійна, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2"
msgid "Safe and secure, eh?"
msgstr "Безпечна й надійна, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "Safe and secure, eh?"
msgstr "Безпечна й надійна, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "I miss the old you."
msgstr "Я сумую за старою тобою."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "I like the look of that!"
msgstr "Я в захваті від її вигляду!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "I like the look of that!"
msgstr "Я в захваті від її вигляду!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "Oh no. Walruses again!"
msgstr "О ні. Знову ті моржі!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "My granddad wore a hat like that."
msgstr "Мій дідо носив подібний капелюх."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "This won't be safe come winter."
msgstr "Взимку тут буде небезпечно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "Walruses are nearby, eh?"
msgstr "Моржі десь близько, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "He had a cavity, eh?"
msgstr "Він мав карієс, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER"
msgid "That wasn't very polite, eh?"
msgstr "Це було не надто ввічливо, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I thought you said you knew how to build a campfire?"
msgstr "Хіба ти не казав, що вмієш розпалювати багаття?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey, %s! Nice seeing someone from my neck of the woods!"
msgstr "Привіт, %s! Радий здибати когось з рідних лісових країв!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST"
msgid "C'mon kiddo, let's get you a heart."
msgstr "Ходімо, малий, знайдімо тобі серце."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER"
msgid "\"Sorry\"'s not gonna cut it this time!"
msgstr "Цього разу «вибач» не допоможе!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks for havin' my back, %s!"
msgstr "Ти груддю стоїш за мене, %s, дякую!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT"
msgid "Lookit that, it's got a little maple leaf on it!"
msgstr "Погляньте-но, на ньому кленовий листочок!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER"
msgid "Yikes! She's got a suprisingly strong right hook."
msgstr "Ой леле! А биє вона, на диво, сильно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Hey, watch where you're burnin'!"
msgstr "Гей, дивися, де ти й що підпалюєш!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC"
msgid "Aboot time you came by for a visit, %s!"
msgstr "Ти саме вчасно, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST"
msgid "I'm lookin' for a heart! Just give me a minute, eh?"
msgstr "Я шукаю серце! Просто дай мені хвильку, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER"
msgid "Lucy and I think it's time we put a stop to you, %s."
msgstr "Ми з Люсі вважаємо, що час покласти тобі край, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER"
msgid "I'm sure glad you're here, %s."
msgstr "Радий тебе тут бачити, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks unnatural."
msgstr "It looks unnatural."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED"
msgid "Don't worry, Luce. I could never trade you."
msgstr "Don't worry, Luce. I could never trade you."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "Wood is the best at burning."
msgstr "Деревина завжди горить найліпше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "Not so useful now, eh?"
msgstr "Вже не дуже-то корисний, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's hard to stay neat and tidy in the woods."
msgstr "У лісі нелегко лишатися охайним і чистим."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "That thing could pull a sled by its lonesome."
msgstr "Навінь не сумніваюся, він самотужки й величезні сани потягнув би."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Burnt blacker than a pile o' pucks."
msgstr "Та він чорніший за відро нафти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Someone punched this pooch's ticket."
msgstr "Цуценя зійшло на пси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Not somethin' you see everyday, eh Luce?"
msgstr "Не щодня таке побачиш, ге, Люсі?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGLET"
msgid "Think you can mess with me, eh?"
msgstr "Думаєш, залякаєш мене, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burned up."
msgstr "Спалав."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Gotta warm this doghouse up, eh?"
msgstr "Розігріймо ж цю будку, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Nice and toasty."
msgstr "Гарний і теплий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Careful where you're swingin', %s."
msgstr "Дивися, на кого замахуєшся, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Watch that fire now, %s."
msgstr "Пильнуй за вогнем, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC"
msgid "%s, buddy! How you doing?"
msgstr "%s, колєґо! Як ся маєш?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST"
msgid "Welp, that's the way the cookie crumbles."
msgstr "Хто до їжі жаден — до біди ладен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER"
msgid "I'm gonna soufflé you alive!"
msgstr "Я зроблю з тебе суфлє живцем!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is a stand up kinda guy."
msgstr "%s — людина, на яку можна покластися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Pretty intimidating, eh Lucy?"
msgstr "Досить грізна, ге, Люсі?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "Why are those bees so angry?"
msgstr "Чому ці бджоли такі сердиті?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "Could be fun times lobbin' these around."
msgstr "Було б весело якось ними пожбурлятися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Out of water."
msgstr "Вода скінчилася."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Better take my turn watering the garden."
msgstr "Час узятися за полив городу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "How can it be both water and melon?"
msgstr "Арбуз, мелон, називайте, як хочете."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "Well, points for creativity."
msgstr "Що ж, винахідливість уражає."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "Wood AND food?!"
msgstr "З лісу — паличка, а з кавуна — льоди?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "I'm not sure aboot grilled fruit..."
msgstr "Я не певен щодо підсмажених фруктів..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Now that's a big one!"
msgstr "Ото здоровезний!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "Maybe I could plant them?"
msgstr "Може б мені їх посадити?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT"
msgid "That flower's tall as a pine tree!"
msgstr "Ця квітка заввишки у смереку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY"
msgid "Just a sapling."
msgstr "Просто саджанець."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB"
msgid "You're just asking to be chopped!"
msgstr "Вони аж просяться, аби їх зрубали!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER"
msgid "Where will you cause the least amount of damage..."
msgstr "І навіть на воді ви завдаєте один клопіт..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP"
msgid "It's a shame wood has to be so flammable."
msgstr "Прикро, що дерева такі легкозаймисті."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "Look at all that tree..."
msgstr "Лише поглянь-но на це дерево..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Some stray bits of tree."
msgstr "Блудні кінцівки дерев."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has raiding and looting on the brain..."
msgstr "У %s в голові лиш рейдерство й грабунок..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "What's with the fires lately, bud?"
msgstr "Що це з пожежами останнім часом, колєжанко?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "%s! Hey bud!"
msgstr "%s! Гей, колєжанко!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "With a heart you'll be feelin' like your mighty self in no time."
msgstr "З серцем ти вмент почуватимешся ліпше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "Your spear versus my axe, let's see whatcha got, eh!"
msgstr "Твій спис проти моєї сокири, погляньмо, хто кого!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "I'm glad you're on our side, %s."
msgstr "Радий, що ти на нашому боці, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "Pretty snappy looking."
msgstr "Симпатичний шолом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT"
msgid "Minus the wings and horn, it's basically a toque."
msgstr "Без крил і рогу, це, своєю суттю, шапка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD"
msgid "That'll take a lickin', eh Luce?"
msgstr "Витримає будь-який удар, опріч твого, ге, Люс?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT"
msgid "It won't wither away, but it also won't be growing anytime soon."
msgstr "Не засохне, проте найближчим часом не ростиме взагалі."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "A good place to spit out your gum."
msgstr "Гарне місце для виплюнутої жуйки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s'll end up on the wrong end of my axe if he's not careful..."
msgstr "Якщо %s погано поводитиметься, відчує гострий кінець моєї сокири..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You'll not want to be burning things, bud."
msgstr "Колєґо, ти ж не хочеш усе тут спалити."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey %s, how you doin' ya big hoser?"
msgstr "Агов, %s. Як ся маєш, бевзню?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "Lucy says I have to help you, %s. Let's get goin'."
msgstr "Люсі сказала, що я маю тобі допомогти, %s. Що ж, ходімо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "Yer still a hoser! Now it's choppin' time!"
msgstr "Був бевзнем, ним і лишився! Готуйся до рубання!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "You're growin' on me, %s. Like a fungus."
msgstr "Моя повага до тебе зросла, %s. Неначе гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Trees made into... paper? How unholy!"
msgstr "Дерева витратили на... папір? Блюзнірство!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hey %s, can't we all just get a-log?"
msgstr "Гей, %s, ліс переріс і ти переростеш! Домовмося!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I better not see anymore fires, little buddy."
msgstr "Диви, аби я ні жаринки не бачив, колєжко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "%s! Hi little buddy!"
msgstr "%s! Привіт, колєжко!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "We better get you a heart, hey kiddo?"
msgstr "Малий, ходімо ліпше добудемо тобі серце?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "'Luce gave me the go-ahead! You're in trouble now, %s!"
msgstr "Люсі дала мені зелене світло! Тобі гаплик, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "You're an alright spider, kiddo."
msgstr "Павучок з тебе що треба, малий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "The skull gives me the willies, too."
msgstr "Цей череп теж викликає мені гусячу шкіру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "Better small spiders than big, I suppose."
msgstr "Ліпше малі павучки, ніж великі, я гадаю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY"
msgid "It has some nasty looking thorns on it."
msgstr "Він має купу бридотних колючок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s, I can't believe what I just SAW! Wait, no..."
msgstr "%s, твої діяння, неначе СОКИРА в серце! Зачекай, ні..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Should you be setting fires, little buddy?"
msgstr "Тобі що, нема чим зайнятися, колєжко?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "%s! Hi little buddy!"
msgstr "%s! Привіт, колєжко!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "With a heart you'll be tip-top in no time, %s."
msgstr "З новим сердечком ти знову будеш тип-топ, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "Hereeee's Woodie!"
msgstr "О-о-о-от і Вуді!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s! You're doin' great, little buddy."
msgstr "%s! Ти молодчина, колєжанко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE"
msgid "Of course I'd remember you, Luce."
msgstr "Of course I'd remember you, Luce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER"
msgid "Think I'm finally getting the hang of this, eh Lucy?"
msgstr "Думаю, я нарешті втямив, як це робиться, ге, Люсі?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE"
msgid "If you can't beat 'em, join 'em."
msgstr "Не можеш здолати — приєднайся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE"
msgid "Not bad, if I do say so mooself."
msgstr "Мушу голосьно визнати, нівроку вийшло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s could learn some manners..."
msgstr "%s, тобі б завадило повчитися добрих манер..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Keep those flames away from my trees!"
msgstr "Тримай цей огень подалі від моїх дерев!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "%s! How ya doin', buddy?"
msgstr "%s! Як ся маєш, колєґо?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "First we'll get you a heart, then we'll get you some bacon, eh %s?"
msgstr "Спершу здобудемо серце, а потому решту всього, ге, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "You're MIME now, %s!"
msgstr "Виставі кінець, а хто слухав молодець, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, you're an alright guy."
msgstr "%s, you're an alright guy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "Better than some of the things I've eaten!"
msgstr "Не найгірше їдло, яке я колись куштував!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "Damp."
msgstr "Вологий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "Doesn't look useful, but I could be wrong."
msgstr "Виглядає не надто корисним, втім, я можу помилятися."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "I hope that doesn't end up hurtin' any lil critters."
msgstr "Сподіваюся, ним не завдадуть кривди жодному звіряті."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s should read an etiquette book once in awhile."
msgstr "%s б не завадило часом ознайомитися з правилами етикету."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Careful around those open flames, Ma'am."
msgstr "Будьте обережні з відкритим полум'ям, мадам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "%s. Ma'am."
msgstr "Мадам %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "You know where I can get a heart, %s?"
msgstr "Ви не знаєте, де я можу роздобути серце, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "This is gonna be a clear cut!"
msgstr "Чітко та ясно: рубаємо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "That's some good work ya did, Ma'am."
msgstr "Дякую за допомогу, мадам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "You're tempting a forest fire, %s..."
msgstr "Ти граєш із великою лісовою пожежею, %s..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Business as usual, I see."
msgstr "Ти собі не зраджуєш, як я бачу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Look who it is! %s!"
msgstr "Погляньте, хто це! %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "Just don't haunt anything while I look for a heart, %s."
msgstr "Просто не роби нічого, поки я не знайду тобі серце, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "Here comes the wildfire!"
msgstr "А от і лісова пожежа!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "You're on fire today, %s. No... actually."
msgstr "Нині ти аж вогню краще, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW_EMBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILLOW_EMBER"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "You haven't been very gentlemanly lately, %s."
msgstr "Останнім часом ти поводишся не так уже й по-панськи, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Was that blaze some sort of experiment, %s?"
msgstr "Той вогонь — частина якогось експерименту, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "%s! Hey buddy!"
msgstr "%s! Гей, колєґо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "Someone should rub a heart on %s."
msgstr "Хтось має зробити тобі масаж серця, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "Enemy of the forest!"
msgstr "Ворог лісу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, you're an alright guy."
msgstr "%s, you're an alright guy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's see what we can find, eh?"
msgstr "Погляньмо, що нам вдасться знайти, ге?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like we got something!"
msgstr "Схоже, ми щось знайшли!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM"
msgid "Reel 'er in!"
msgstr "Підтягуємо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is getting too big for her britches."
msgstr "%s надцінює свої сили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s betrays the forest!"
msgstr "%s зраджує ліс!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC"
msgid "%s! Hey there bud!"
msgstr "%s! Гей, колєжанко!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST"
msgid "Yer looking a little pale, %s."
msgstr "%s, маєш троха нездоровий вигляд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER"
msgid "You're on the chopping block now, %s!"
msgstr "Я тебе під корінь зрубаю, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER"
msgid "I knew we were gonna get along."
msgstr "Я знав, що ми поладнаємо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING"
msgid "Woah! Careful, Lucy!"
msgstr "Отакої! Обережно, Люсі!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT"
msgid "That's a right shame."
msgstr "Дуже прикро."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC"
msgid "Pretty odd looking gadget there."
msgstr "Досить дивний на вигляд ґаджет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER"
msgid "Just aboot dead."
msgstr "На смертній одрі."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF
