#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY"
msgid "Some fancy robot bits."
