msgstr "Тут чи пан, чи ти пропав, ху-ху!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1"
msgid "If I time it just right, the end is in sight!"
msgstr "Якщо час не розрахую — дуже скоро пошкодую!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2"
msgid "I mustn't rock the boat!"
msgstr "Я не повинен розгойдувати човна!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh I simply couldn't."
msgstr "Йой, я просто не можу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE"
msgid "It is making a pact with another."
msgstr "Укладає договір з кимось іншим."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM"
msgid "Not for me, I see."
msgstr "Не для мене, бачу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT"
