msgstr "Не можу, не буду, не мушу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS"
