msgstr "Прекрасне погруддя біфало."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO_SKETCH"
