#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_victorian"
msgid "These are their diving gears."
msgstr "Водолазне спорядження."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_wip
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_wip"
msgid "A partially constructed automaton."
msgstr "Частково зібраний автомат."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_wrestler"
msgid "You don't want to meet these cold mechanical eyes in the ring."
msgstr "Вам не схочеться зустрітися з цим холодним механічним поглядом на ринзі."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_yule"
msgid "WX-78 has oft been accused of acting wooden during the holidays."
msgstr "WX-78 часто звинувачують у лежанні колодою під час свят."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.w_radio_basic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.w_radio_basic"
